d   (13K+ members)\n⚽ https://x.com/FPLFocal\n📷   / fplfocal  \n🦋 https://bsky.app/profile/fpl.page\n🎧 https://linktr.ee/FPLFocal (podcasts)\n📩 oscar@fpl.page\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSources:\nhttps://fplreview.com\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📽 Recommended videos:\n   • The Biggest FPL Score Of All-Time | Record...  \n   • The All-Time FPL Dream Team | INSANE Scores  \n   • The Worst FPL Score Of All-Time | Disaster...  \n   • The Greatest FPL Manager Of All-Time | Fáb...  \n   • FPL's Worst EVER Disasters  \n   • If 11/12 Messi was in FPL | IMPOSSIBLE Sco...   \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🏆 Mini-league Champions\n25/26: David Whitlock\n24/25: Lovro Budišin\n23/24: Jonas Sand Låbakk\n22/23: Leo Karaj\n21/22: Ben Osman\n20/21: Kiran Paul\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎵 Song credit: Harris Heller - Cielo\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":14,"length":39,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwjbrsyI9quWAxUeJLMFHXO4IGdIq-bD1Lq4m9jyAcoBBAhnvOI=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUkhHSHZjYjM3WHJIVGhybUMtWTg3ZXxBR3JiS2FrVlZjYmhsRWJ2bmtzWWtzaDNFN2RzSGV1bkhfRDJiV29wdXJPZG9EbmNBWndiQUtweGN6OVIyei1YWmtqUC12T1JJMlhUU19VbzRBUXZxalVHSVNiZDNIU25IX1NY\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fget.mysportspix.app%2F%3Fc%3Dfplfocal\u0026v=8rBtw6qQ8ys","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUkhHSHZjYjM3WHJIVGhybUMtWTg3ZXxBR3JiS2FrVlZjYmhsRWJ2bmtzWWtzaDNFN2RzSGV1bkhfRDJiV29wdXJPZG9EbmNBWndiQUtweGN6OVIyei1YWmtqUC12T1JJMlhUU19VbzRBUXZxalVHSVNiZDNIU25IX1NY\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fget.mysportspix.app%2F%3Fc%3Dfplfocal\u0026v=8rBtw6qQ8ys","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":325,"length":26,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwjbrsyI9quWAxUeJLMFHXO4IGdIq-bD1Lq4m9jyAcoBBAhnvOI=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadat